NAME
       kill - send a signal to a process

SYNOPSIS
       kill [-s SIGNAL | -SIGNAL] PID...
       kill -l [NUMBER]

DESCRIPTION
       Send SIGNAL (TERM by default) to the processes with the given PIDs.
       SIGNAL is a name (TERM, SIGKILL) or a number.

OPTIONS
       -s SIGNAL, -SIGNAL
           signal to send

       -l
           list signal names, or translate NUMBER to a name

EXAMPLES
       kill 42
       kill -9 42
       kill -l

SEE ALSO
       ps(1)
